# Golden compiler artifacts and raw C# string literals are byte-sensitive.
# Canonical repository representation for all compiler corpus text.
# Tests normalize emitted text before semantic comparison; byte pins below are
# computed against this LF representation rather than a checkout-local form.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cs text eol=lf
*.csproj text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsxtest text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.tson text eol=lf
*.cope text eol=lf
